{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～虽然听说在这附近常常看到……”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4891", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但果然不是想看就能看到呢。”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "进入２月之后，连纱凪家附近也常出现不可思议生物的目击证言。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们今天也根据那些情报寻找熊喵一族。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过毕竟不是那么简单就能发现。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“最近理央也会在半夜偷跑出门找熊喵一族，我好担心。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4892", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“他说要增加新的手下，眼神还放光呢。”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4893", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是他能喜欢上动物太好了呢。”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是啦。如果能顺便对姐姐也温柔一点就好了……”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4894", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然嘴上抱怨，但纱凪的表情还是很开心。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那姐姐这边就由我来温柔对待吧。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要、要是你变得更温柔我会困扰的！”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4895", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾太宠我了。要是不偶尔推开我的话，会被别人认定是笨蛋情侣喔。”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4896", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没办法推开你啊。”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算推开我也会跟着你的没关系。”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4897", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也有点想看看冷淡的新吾呢。”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4898", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘呐，这种时间你要去哪里啊？’", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4899", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘跟你没关系。’", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘不是约好了今天要一直在一起吗！’", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4900", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘我改变心意了。’", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘……你要去其他女人那里吗？’", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4901", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘…………’", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘那个叫美羽的女人？那个女人就那么好吗！？’", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4902", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘你别啰哩八嗦的，乖乖在这里等就对了。’", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘反正你也离不开我吧？’", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘！？’", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4903", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘等我想来我会再来的。’", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘你、你什么时候会来？’", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4904", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘这还用问吗？’", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘当然是我想抱你的时候──’", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊啊……”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4905", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了？突然身体紧绷……”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没、没什么，只是妄想一下而已。”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4906", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………我怎么会有这种兴趣啊。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4907", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪抱紧我的手臂，还用头顶来顶去。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……身体娇小的女孩子真的好可爱。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好想从背后抱住她不放。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊对了，就快到情人节了。”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4908", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可是我没有做过巧克力……”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4909", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你也没送给家人过吗？”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“理央的份我都是在商店买的。”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4910", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是今年可不能那样呢。”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4911", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "情人节即将到来，班上的气氛也改变了。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身为男人，这是无论如何都会在意的节日。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼哼～呐，想要我做的巧克力吗？很甜的那种。”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4912", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很甜？”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很甜喔。因为是送给新吾的巧克力嘛♪”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4913", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着一天比一天更可爱的纱凪，我忍不住害羞了。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？怎么了，为什么要抓脸颊？”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4914", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，没什么啦。”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“会痒的话我帮你抓吧？”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4915", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，等一下！”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……？”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4916", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，从刚才开始纱凪的胸部就碰到手臂……”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，抱歉……”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4917", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没、没关系啦！……我才是，抱歉。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果我们两个人都害羞地抓脸颊了。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我才是，对你更抱歉。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4918", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，再多找一下熊喵的同族吧。”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说、说的也是，这才是目的嘛！”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4919", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4920", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沉默之后，纱凪再次抱住我的手臂。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……一靠近自然就会碰到呢。”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4921", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是说啊。”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一直压着的话会习惯吗？”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4922", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，这个……好想有点难……”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在习惯之前，我尽力维持的理智可能就要先破碎了。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "应该说，我觉得我一辈子都不会习惯吧。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟我是这么喜欢纱凪。我可以肯定今后也是。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这对大小适中的隆起，我身为男人当然会起反应──", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4923", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“～～～！”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸嘿嘿，看到害羞的新吾我好像心动了♪”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4924", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你也是很可爱的家伙喔～”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 242, "voice": "_sn4925", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这句话，我想原封不动还给她。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
